# x86-64 Linux syscall layer: raw syscall0..6 invocation via the `syscall`
# instruction, syscall numbers, and operation wrappers for filesystem calls.
# Selected automatically via the compiler's "native" arch token
# (uranite.os.arch.native.syscall). The aarch64 variant mirrors this API,
# translating legacy calls (open, stat, ...) to their *at equivalents.
